  <item>
    <title>【公开录制vol.1】生日快录，正式发布</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673db36d8d1233fb0dad7a28</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673db36d8d1233fb0dad7a28</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 10:24:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众好久不见！停更了一个月以后，我们终于更新了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们借着一起即兴七周年的机会攒了个大的！那就是现场公开录制，主播们纷纷表示这是有史以来最轻松的一期播客，因为多了很多观众朋友们的分享，具体都分享了些什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>请听本期节目吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主持人：不肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：老那，小猫，大山</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你在上海，也想参加我们的播客录制，请加小助手：easyimprov-17</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 到底有没有人抓过周啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 一起即兴即刻成立红楼梦研究小组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 第一次生日很重要，你还记得吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 一家子就奶奶记性最好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 不肉公布关于自己的都市传闻，真相竟如此扑朔迷离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a> 小猫炫耀自己生日礼物，惹得大山当场摔手机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 不肉承认公开录制的动机，并表示要写自传&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3004">50:04</a> 不成功的跨国情好比冬天的西瓜，食之无味弃之可惜啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3284">54:44</a> 只要你用心，就算是前男友也得给你记住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3652">60:52</a> 啥家庭送礼送企鹅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4025">1:07:05</a> 这个礼物不费钱，费脑子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4342">1:12:22</a> 收魔杖收到四副筷子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4671">1:17:51</a> 送礼送到骨头上听说过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5037">1:23:57</a> 小猫把送礼玩成抽奖</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpFXZ-mrOX0fCNPH2gXNiY4FMEZ3.m4a" length="150425877" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:43:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBb0dar9h_Q4Gn7frkFreWSI5nw.png"/>
