  <item>
    <title>【即兴特辑】即兴是男人的加油站，女人的美容院</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670f46700d2f24f2897aab1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670f46700d2f24f2897aab1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Oct 2024 04:51:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听今天的即兴特辑！本期节目，我们将深入探讨即兴表演背后的灵魂人物——即兴老师。他们当时是如何进入这个无剧本的世界的？他们如何用智慧、幽默和创造力点燃舞台？我们会聊到即兴老师的教学理念、他们遇到的有趣故事。无论你是即兴表演的新手还是经验丰富的表演者，这期节目都将为你揭开即兴老师的神秘面纱，带你感受即兴的无限可能！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本周主播：不肉、大山、小猫、小池</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群请加】easyimprov-17</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">1:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【不肉】大家久违的即兴特辑终于来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">3:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小猫】上课最资深的老师：上的课最多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">6:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小猫】我上了这么多课，我觉得上课不应该是炫技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">9:34</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【不肉】互相成就</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> &nbsp;【大山】没办法把握内容和时间的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> &nbsp;【不肉】我就是按照课纲，我也不管你，他一定能准时完成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> &nbsp;【不肉】必须感谢小猫老师，会给我很多反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> &nbsp;【不肉】做即兴挣钱的全是当老师的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> &nbsp;【不肉】老师怎么告诉我的，现在就怎么分享给你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 【不肉】学即兴对我来说很大的一个拓展就是我很少纠结了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1633">27:13</a> &nbsp;【不肉】拍球里面的学问太大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> &nbsp;【小池】要排序的话，那肯定不分伯仲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> &nbsp;【小池】不肉老师演出很强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> &nbsp;【小池】是，是还行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> 【大山】骗兄弟可以，别骗自己哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2441">40:41</a> 【不肉】怎么去定义即兴入门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">44:35</a> 【不肉】如果你想成为即兴演员，一定要有足够演出时长的积累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2929">48:49</a> 【不肉】不好笑的演出一定不好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3101">51:41</a> 【小猫】这时候老师的作用就体现了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3319">55:19</a> 【小猫】希望越来越多人学会即兴</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lluBYEEM7cLHtvSdVZEN_IDbnZcS.m4a" length="87311061" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:09</itunes:duration>
