  <item>
    <title>【EPⅡ.03】省钱小妙招，鼓起大钱包</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6703ce3881cdab3a9345c342</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6703ce3881cdab3a9345c342</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2024 12:04:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们，告诉大家一个好消息！您的2024年法定假日余额为0啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有假期的时候就是攒钱最好的时候，所以在国庆假期的最后一天，我们给大家带来的主题是“省钱”</span></p><span></span><p><span>俗话说得好，吃不穷，穿不穷，算计不到才受穷！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期各位主播们将分享一些省钱路上遇到的坑和一些小技巧，帮助各位在日常生活中节省开支。无论是买东西时的仔细观察、吃饭住行的开销，还是一些简单的DIY方法，这期节目将带给各位满满的省钱灵感。让我们一起探讨如何消费，享受生活的同时不让钱包吃紧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>但同时也不要为了省钱，而不注意身体健康哦，欢迎各位给我们投稿，分享自己生活中的省钱小妙招。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本周主播：小猫、大山、阿方、老那、小池</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群请加】easyimprov-17</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">2:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【老那】钱就是海绵，怎么挤都没有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">3:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小池】在某鱼上买了山西交通联合地铁卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">4:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小池】充值上海公交卡app</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">7:24</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【老那】检测到宿主的公交卡异常活跃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">8:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【老那】这马赛克一个挡膝盖，一个挡脚踝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">9:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【大山】4年省了6900</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> &nbsp;【大山】我用这辆车跑过外卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> &nbsp;【小猫】我从家骑车上班，1个半小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> &nbsp;【小猫】之前天很热，实在受不了，下车买了瓶饮料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 【阿方】5000买的飞机票，退票显示只能退2000块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a> &nbsp;【阿方】没有弯弯绕绕，直接退款</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> &nbsp;【阿方】买东西的小妙招就是都看几眼，注意陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> &nbsp;【小猫】被抓住了，那还给你咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> &nbsp;【老那】坐公交车比坐地铁便宜1块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> 【老那】我们可以帮你照看宠物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 【老那】屠龙者终成恶龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 【大山】成为多多月卡会员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 【小池】自己做饭最省钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2408">40:08</a> 【大山】为了省钱，买5个馒头吃一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2599">43:19</a> 【ALL】国潮餐盒，黑色塑料勺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 【小猫】省钱归省钱，身体健康还是第一位</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo7UDZF76iJ-YRPI4b8FUi5vA-Cb.m4a" length="66357649" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBb0dar9h_Q4Gn7frkFreWSI5nw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【EPⅡ.02】生活中的奇葩事儿，捂好鼻子别窜味儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f5365b2adfe48b83a46fd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f5365b2adfe48b83a46fd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 10:24:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的节目特别有味道，建议大家喷点香水来增添氛围。正如那些奇葩的事情，听起来越有趣，收听体验就越好！这期的主题是生活中那些让人哭笑不得的奇葩事，或者说“糗事”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们都经历过一些尴尬瞬间，可能是在公共场合说错话、出门忘记穿鞋，甚至是发错信息给不该发的人。同样通过这些奇葩故事，我们可以看到生活的幽默与不完美。也许这些糗事让我们感到羞愧，但回头一想，却也成了生活中的美好回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同样也希望大家能在节目中找到共鸣，分享自己的糗事，让我们一起大笑、一起反思，主要是“大笑”，毕竟，生活的乐趣就藏在这些小插曲中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本周主播：小猫、大山、小池</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群请加】easyimprov-17</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">3:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小猫】我感觉最近生活比较平淡，没啥奇葩事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">5:06</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【小猫】签合同前有求必应，一签合同就跟我装傻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">7:26</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【大山】等最后一天收拾行李的时候发现东西不见了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> &nbsp;【大山】我难过因为我钱没了，我姐难过因为香水没了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> &nbsp;【小猫】奇葩的就是他们交通线路复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> &nbsp;【大山】日本特辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> &nbsp;【小池】以前在报纸上面看到过日本有什么吃“石”节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1262">21:02</a> &nbsp;【小池】草莓味的“石”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">24:05</a> &nbsp;【小池】有时候肚子疼会忍不住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a> 【小猫】低估了它的威力，高估了自己的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> &nbsp;【小池】带听众远离恶臭味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> &nbsp;【大山】越喝越觉得这个水好怪啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> &nbsp;【小猫】这是哪是随地呀，这是随肠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> &nbsp;【小猫】他走路是飞机状</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 【大山】有一个同学上课突然站起来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 【小猫】欢迎大家来我们的窝点玩</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpkX9QaIAWIE4yZ__oesncWwJrqz.m4a" length="67242077" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBb0dar9h_Q4Gn7frkFreWSI5nw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【EpⅡ.01】重新开头，我们决定从小事聊起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e7fc485ca6d0ace34bafd4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e7fc485ca6d0ace34bafd4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 09:37:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众朋友们，真的是好久好久好久不见啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们经过一段时间的休整（断更），我们决定开启我们的S2赛季，我们也对话题进行了调整，让话题变得更家常，也对播放时间进行了一定的把控。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近主题：最近比较烦，有爱情、有对亲情、有对金钱、也有对日常。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个话题会持续一段时间，因为我们想大家生活中一定有很多的烦心事，所以欢迎各位听众分享最近比较烦心的事，可以直接留言在本期节目下面，也可以向客服号dada投稿，我们会把您的烦恼和我们的烦恼一起分享在后面一期的节目当中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然，还是祝大家少些烦恼，多谢快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中秋节愉快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本周主播：不肉、小猫、蛋糕、小池</span></p><span></span><p><span>【听友群请加】easyimprov-17</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【不肉】从默默无闻到有人喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">2:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【蛋糕】第一任制作人过期了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">5:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【不肉】第二季播客的调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">6:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【不肉】把烦恼说出来对自己也是一个调节，也欢迎听众来投稿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">8:23</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【蛋糕】没录播客的这段期间经历了一场爱情的轮回</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;【蛋糕】我对我自己和对她理性的判断全部都写下来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> &nbsp;【不肉】找伴侣应该找怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> &nbsp;【小池】我恋爱经历比较少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="763">12:43</a> &nbsp;【小池】在爱情中能够互相迁就对方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 【小猫】在爱情中我是喜欢表达的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1023">17:03</a> &nbsp;【不肉】你们都没有错，只是忘了怎么退后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> &nbsp;【小池】聊一些比较沉重的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> &nbsp;【不肉】我最近的烦恼就是最近的烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1944">32:24</a> &nbsp;【小猫】飞机场一日游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> &nbsp;【小猫】最近的烦心事跟钱挂钩，也希望咱窝点越来越好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> 【小猫】小猫老师的省钱小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">45:40</a> 【小猫】周四小猫老师的夜校课</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liVTYRtU8x-yxjCeQ0H1PoGM1DMk.m4a" length="68809201" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqBb0dar9h_Q4Gn7frkFreWSI5nw.png"/>
